# Readme and version bumps

When making any user-facing change to this plugin:

1. Update `readme.txt`:
   - Bump `Stable tag` to match the new plugin version
   - Add a changelog entry under `== Changelog ==` describing the change
   - Update Description, Installation, or FAQ if behavior or UI changed
2. Bump `Version` in `book-cpt.php` and `BOOK_CPT_VERSION` to match the stable tag
3. Keep `Tested up to` accurate when WordPress compatibility is verified

Do not skip readme updates as part of the same task that introduced the change.
